{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20276","headline":"伤歌行 · 张籍","name":"伤歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄门诏下促收捕，京兆尹系御史府。\n出门无复部曲随，亲戚相逢不容语。\n辞成谪尉南海州，受命不得须臾留。\n身着青衫骑恶马，中门之外无送者。\n邮夫防吏急諠驱，往往惊堕马蹄下。\n长安里中荒大宅，朱门已除十二戟。\n高堂舞榭锁管弦，美人遥望西南天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}